@hnyls2002 @cctry (Merge Oncall for `managers`) — gentle ping from the author.

This is a small hardening change in `TokenizerManager`'s client-disconnect probe (`_stream_one_response`), with a CPU-only unit test registered in `base-a-test-cpu`. CI has not run because the PR is missing the `run-ci` label. Could one of you add it (`/tag-and-rerun-ci`; `/run-cpu-ci` is enough for this change)?

#41472 touches the same two call sites. I'm happy to align with whichever approach you prefer, and I'll rebase or address review feedback promptly.

